{"articleNo":"793","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=793&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"2010 여름계절수업 대구통학버스 이용안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2009.05.13","hit":"19682","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><!--StartFragment-->&nbsp;<span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’; FONT-SIZE: 13.5pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">&nbsp;\n</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; FONT-FAMILY: ’HY헤드라인M’; COLOR: #282828; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; FONT-FAMILY: ’HY헤드라인M’; COLOR: #282828; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; FONT-FAMILY: ’HY헤드라인M’; COLOR: #282828; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"></span></span></span>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\" align=\"left\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; FONT-FAMILY: ’HY헤드라인M’; COLOR: #282828; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<font size=\"4\">&nbsp;&nbsp;<u> 2010 여름계절학기 대구통학버스 이용안내<br></u></font></span></p>\n<span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">\n<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><br></p>\n</span>\n<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: ’HY수평선M’; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"></span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: ’HY수평선M’; LETTER-SPACING: 0.4pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"></span><font face=\"돋움\"><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’HY수평선M’; LETTER-SPACING: 0.3pt\">여름 계절수업 기간동안 대구통학버스를 다음과 같이 운행할 예정입니</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’HY수평선M’\">다.</span></font></font></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’HY수평선M’\"><font size=\"3\" face=\"돋움\">이용하고자 하는 학생들은 다음 사항을 참고하여 후원금을 납부하시기&nbsp;바랍니다.</font></span></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’HY수평선M’\"><font size=\"3\" face=\"돋움\">- 아&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 래 - </font></span></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><font face=\"돋움\"><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’HY수평선M’\">1. 후원금 납부금액 :</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’HY수평선M’; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"> 90,000원<br></span></font></font><font face=\"돋움\"><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’HY수평선M’\">2. 후원금 납부기간 :</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’HY수평선M’; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"> 2010.5.24(월)~2010.5.28(금)<br></span></font></font><font face=\"굴림\"><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’HY수평선M’\">3. 납부장소 :&nbsp;농협<br></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’HY수평선M’; COLOR: #282828; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">4. 납부방법 : 지로용지에 의한 납부</span></font></font><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’굴림’; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">&nbsp;<br></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’HY수평선M’\"><font face=\"굴림\">&nbsp;&nbsp;가. 지로번호 : </font></span></font><font face=\"굴림\"><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’HY수평선M’; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">6951519<br></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’HY수평선M’\">&nbsp;&nbsp;<font face=\"굴림\">나. 금&nbsp; 액 : </font></span><font face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’HY수평선M’; COLOR: #282828; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">입금</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’HY수평선M’; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">할 금액 기재</span></font></font></font><font size=\"3\"><font face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’HY수평선M’; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\">(예 90,000원)<br></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’HY수평선M’\">&nbsp;&nbsp;<font face=\"굴림\">다. </font></span></font><font face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’HY수평선M’; LETTER-SPACING: 1pt\"><font face=\"굴림\">입금자</font></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’HY수평선M’\"> : </span></font></font><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’HY수평선M’; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"><font size=\"3\" face=\"굴림\">학부(과), 학번, 성명&nbsp;<br></font></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’HY수평선M’\"><font size=\"3\" face=\"굴림\">5. 운행기간 : 2010. 6. 23(수) ~ 2010. 7. 9(금)<br></font></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’HY수평선M’\"><font size=\"3\" face=\"굴림\">6. 운행노선&nbsp;<br></font></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’HY수평선M’\"><font size=\"3\" face=\"굴림\">&nbsp;가. 등교&nbsp;<br>&nbsp;&nbsp; -&nbsp;시민회관(07:50)→학교(08:40)&nbsp;<br>&nbsp;&nbsp; - 서부정류장(07:40)→성서고속다리(07:50)→학교(08:40)<br></font></span><span class=\"HStyle0\"><font face=\"굴림\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’HY수평선M’\"><font size=\"3\">&nbsp;</font><font size=\"3\" face=\"굴림\">나. 하교&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<br>&nbsp;&nbsp; - 학교(16:10)→시민회관(17:00)<br>&nbsp;&nbsp; - 학교(16:10)→성서고속도로(17:00)→서부정류장(17:10)</font></span></font><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’HY수평선M’\"><font size=\"3\" face=\"굴림\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<br></font></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’HY수평선M’\"><font size=\"3\" face=\"굴림\">7.</font></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’HY수평선M’\">&nbsp;<font size=\"3\" face=\"굴림\">후원금 납부후&nbsp;</font></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’HY수평선M’; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"><font size=\"3\"><font face=\"굴림\">이용노선&nbsp;및 통장사본, 연락처을 </font><font face=\"굴림\"><font color=\"#000000\">학생회관 1층(학사<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 서비스센터 </font>제출</font></font></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’HY수평선M’\"><font size=\"3\" face=\"굴림\">하여 주시고, 교통카드를 발급받으시기&nbsp;바람</font></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’HY수평선M’\"><font size=\"3\"><br></font></span><font face=\"굴림\"><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’HY수평선M’\"><font color=\"#0000ff\" face=\"굴림\">8</font><font face=\"굴림\"><font color=\"#0000ff\">. 코스별 이용학생이 35명 미만일 경우에는</font><font color=\"#0000ff\"><u> \"코스 통합\" 또는 \"운행<br></u>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </font><u><font color=\"#0000ff\">하지&nbsp; 않을 수 있음\".<br></font></u>&nbsp; -&nbsp;운행하지 않을시에는 <span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’HY수평선M’; COLOR: #ff0000\">“</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’HY수평선M’; COLOR: #ff0000; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">즉시 환불”</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: ’HY수평선M’\"> 조치 함</span></font></span></font></font></span></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
